#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "WowShipping – Weight Based Flexible Table Rate Shipping for WooCommerce"
msgstr "WowShipping – Gewichtsbasiertes flexibles Tabellenversand für WooCommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "WowShipping allows store owners to define flexible shipping rates based on conditions like weight, destination, price, item count etc."
msgstr "WowShipping ermöglicht es Shop-Besitzern, flexible Versandkosten basierend auf Bedingungen wie Gewicht, Zielort, Preis, Artikelanzahl usw. zu definieren."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "WPXPO"
msgstr "WPXPO"

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://www.wpxpo.com/about"
msgstr "https://www.wpxpo.com/about"

